{
  "$schema": "https://json.schemastore.org/sarif-2.1.0.json",
  "version": "2.1.0",
  "_comment_": [
    "Hand-written, in rust-doctor shape. Every result below is a branch of resolve()/reanchor(), and the",
    "two note-level ones are the withholding branch: 115 of those had accumulated in the security tab",
    "against a green gate, which is what the script was written for.",
    "The paths are real facts about THIS tree, deliberately. src/handlers.rs exists only under",
    "mcp-server, so it resolves; Cargo.toml exists at the root and in both members, so it is ambiguous.",
    "If the workspace is restructured this fixture goes red, which is correct - knowing where the files",
    "are is the script whole job.",
    "THE LAST TWO WARNINGS ARE CI-11 (#175). Both are unplaceable, by two different routes: one has",
    "parents that simply hold no manifest, the other has no parent but the workspace root. Until #175",
    "both re-anchored onto the root Cargo.toml and this transcript PINNED that, deliberately, because",
    "TEST-48 (#163) put rewriting the scripts out of scope and an absent question is worse than a wrong",
    "answer on the record. They now keep their own uri and say they could not be located, which is what",
    "reanchor()'s docstring had claimed all along."
  ],
  "runs": [
    {
      "tool": { "driver": { "name": "rust-doctor", "version": "0.2.0" } },
      "results": [
        {
          "ruleId": "excessive-clone",
          "level": "note",
          "message": { "text": "Clone of a value that may implement Copy" },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": { "uri": "src/handlers.rs", "uriBaseId": "%SRCROOT%" },
                "region": { "startLine": 10 }
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "ruleId": "excessive-clone",
          "level": "note",
          "message": { "text": "Clone of a value that may implement Copy" },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": { "uri": "src/handlers.rs", "uriBaseId": "%SRCROOT%" },
                "region": { "startLine": 20 }
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "ruleId": "skipped-pass",
          "level": "note",
          "message": { "text": "coverage: no report found" },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": { "uri": "Cargo.toml", "uriBaseId": "%SRCROOT%" },
                "region": { "startLine": 1 }
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "ruleId": "unwrap-in-production",
          "level": "warning",
          "message": { "text": "a crate-relative uri that resolves to exactly one member" },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": { "uri": "src/handlers.rs", "uriBaseId": "%SRCROOT%" },
                "region": { "startLine": 30 }
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "ruleId": "multiple_crate_versions",
          "level": "warning",
          "message": { "text": "a file rust-doctor created and deleted; re-anchored to the crate manifest" },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": { "uri": "mcp-server/clippy.toml", "uriBaseId": "%SRCROOT%" },
                "region": { "startLine": 1 }
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "ruleId": "cargo_common_metadata",
          "level": "error",
          "message": { "text": "a uri that exists in the root and in both members" },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": { "uri": "Cargo.toml", "uriBaseId": "%SRCROOT%" },
                "region": { "startLine": 1 }
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "ruleId": "panic-in-library",
          "level": "warning",
          "message": { "text": "a uri that is nowhere in the tree, with parents; published unchanged, CI-11" },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": { "uri": "nowhere/at/all.rs", "uriBaseId": "%SRCROOT%" },
                "region": { "startLine": 1 }
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "ruleId": "result-unit-error",
          "level": "warning",
          "message": { "text": "a uri whose ONLY parent is the workspace root; the loop finds no candidate at all" },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": { "uri": "totally_made_up.rs", "uriBaseId": "%SRCROOT%" },
                "region": { "startLine": 1 }
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "ruleId": "hardcoded-secrets",
          "level": "warning",
          "message": { "text": "an absolute path from another machine's checkout" },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": { "uri": "/somewhere/else/src/main.rs" },
                "region": { "startLine": 1 }
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
